* Modded-British 100 W three-mode head, preamp (see preamp_full.net for the drawing and the reading notes), split in three solvers (amp.json
* "stages", docs/PLAN_CPU.md). preamp_full.net is the whole circuit, the reference the split is checked against (sas_split_check). The stages:
*   preamp.net  V1A and V1B: the input, the Clean chain (passive stack, volume, V1B) and what V1A hands to V2A;
*   stage2.net  V2A and V2B: the BE / HBE chain up to the Gain pot;
*   stage3.net  V3A, V3B (cathode follower), the SAT clipper, the tone stack, the Master and the output node, with the end of the Clean chain.
* A stage's load that sits in a later one is repeated in it (linear parts only), and the later stage is driven through a 1 ohm source at the cut
* node, so the loaded voltage passes unchanged: node in (V2A's raw input), V1A's plate p1 (the HBE feed), V2B's plate p3 (the Gain network) and
* V1B's plate p5 (the end of the Clean chain). The supply is repeated in each stage with the series resistance of the rail source scaled by
* (total current / this stage's current) and the decoupling capacitor at x by the inverse; the B+2 / B+3 filter belongs to stage 3 whole.
* What is lost is the interaction through the shared supply.
*
* This file: stage 1.

.nodes x gin in pkb1 pkb2 pkk1 pkk2 pkk4 ng1 p1 n1 k1 ct ctw cu cb cbw cbw2 br1 br2 cvw p5 k5 cd cl mo c3n v1o v2s ng2

V VRAIL x 317.9 430
C C28 x 0 6.920u
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p

R RJ1 in 0 1M
R R2 in ng1 33k
T V1A ng1 p1 k1 12AX7
R R9 x n1 220k
R R3 n1 p1 100k
C C8 n1 p1 500p
R R4 k1 0 2k7
C C5 k1 0 0.68u

C C3 p1 c3n 2n2
R R5 c3n v1o 1M
R R6 v1o 0 68k
R SW_V1 v1o v2s 1e12
R R11 v2s 0 10M
R R7 v2s ng2 33k
R RG2 ng2 0 1G

C C10 n1 ct 50p
R R25 n1 cu 100k
C C7 cu cb 0.022u
C C2 cu cbw 0.022u
R VR_CT ct ctw 1
R VR_CB ctw cb 1
R VR_CBT cb cbw2 1
R VR_CBB cbw2 0 1
R R42 cbw2 0 10k
R RCW cbw2 cbw 1
C C11 ctw br1 220p
R SW_BR1 br1 cvw 1
C C12 ctw br2 100p
R SW_BR2 br2 cvw 1e12
R VR_CVT ctw cvw 1
R VR_CVB cvw 0 1
T V1B cvw p5 k5 12AX7
R R12 x p5 100k
R R14 k5 0 820
C C21 k5 0 10u
C C9 p5 cd 0.022u
R R15 cd cl 470k
R R22 cl 0 470k

R SW_CLN_OUT cl mo 1
R RMLOAD mo 0 1M
